### Changes in this version (8.1.0-pre.1) since 8.0.0

#### New features:
 - [2026-10-14:]: added in-core/out-core ('-rw') option for std2
 - [2026-10-14:]: added support for configurables index
 - [2026-10-13:]: allowed no limit on method part endpoint
 - [2026-10-13:]: added ID to method part end point
 - [2026-10-13:]: added method endpoints to get programs/destinations matching a class name
 - [2026-10-09:]: added atom_defaults to other program parsers
 - [2026-10-09:]: added option to disable the xtb density cube file

#### Bugfixes:
 - [2026-10-14:]: fixed a bug when using basis sets from the BSE that don't contain ECPs
 - [2026-10-12:]: added patch for unusual charactres in endpoints
 - [2026-10-09:]: fixed xTB calculations crashing if topo file is missing for some reason
 - [2026-10-09:]: fixed error message when trying to delete xtb cube file but no results have been parsed
 - [2026-10-09:]: fixed xTB program not using latest 6.7.1
 - [2026-10-09:]: ulimit is now automatically set based on the total allocated memory

#### Documentation changes:
 - [2026-10-08:]: updated documentation to v8 references

#### Testing updates:
 - [2026-10-09:]: updated tests to reflect new methods in libary

#### Miscellaneous:
 - [2026-10-14:]: update last modified
 - [2026-10-12:]: replaced missing chars with empty strings instead of underscores in endpoint
 - [2026-10-09:]: fixed wrong type for xtb cube option
 - [2026-10-09:]: added better handling of xTB cube file
 - [2026-10-09:]: bumped version to 8.1.0-pre.1
 - [2026-10-09:]: added SOS-wPBEPP86 to auto characterisation
 - [2026-10-09:]: bumped version to 8.0.0-pre.1
 - [2026-10-09:]: added SCS and SOS version of wPBEPP86 to library
 - [2026-10-08:]: updated docs workflow
 - [2026-10-07:]: bumped version to 8.0.0